{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10284020","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10284020","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1028402001:1":{"text":"エルローランおじさま、どうしてこんなところで沈んだお顔をなさってるのですか？","source_cn":"埃罗兰大叔，你怎么愁眉苦脸的一个人在这里？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x192D8F2E93B5A8DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1028402002:1":{"text":"ライカか。はぁ、もうすぐ雨季になるというのに、僕の古い家の梁がなぜか黒く腐り始めちゃったんだ。梁を交換することもできないし、新しい家もまだ完成してなくて。","source_cn":"是莱卡啊。唉，雨季快到了，我这旧房子的房梁不知道为什么...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x404458C132C1020D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1028402003:1":{"text":"木材が足りないんだよ！村の採集部隊が出発してもう十日以上経つのに、なんの知らせもないんだ。","source_cn":"木料不够啊！村子里的采集队出去十几天了，可一点消息都没有。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF802C7BA84045C71","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1028402004:1":{"text":"ロンロンは家作りのことはよく分かりませんが、建材になる木材を探すのには時間がかかるんじゃないですか？","source_cn":"满满不是很懂建房子，可是，要寻找合适的木料确实需要很多...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD60D132581969392","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1028402005:1":{"text":"普通はそこまでかからないはずなんだ……彼らは十日分の補給物資しか持って行ってないしね。","source_cn":"照理说用不了这么久……他们只带了十天的补给。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x167BE51D36C84C59","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1028402006:1":{"text":"はぁ、何かあったのかな。追加物資を取りに戻ってくる隊員もいないなんて……","source_cn":"唉，也不知道是不是出什么事了，他们连个回来补充食物的人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE834A43D7FA9A95B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1028402007:1":{"text":"十日も戻ってきていなくて、なんの知らせもないんですか？うーん……確かに変ですね。","source_cn":"十几天都没回来，而且还没有任何消息？嗯……这确实不对劲。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x16B4479F2F757CAC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1028402008:1":{"text":"ライカ……もし時間があれば、彼らを探してきてくれないかな？","source_cn":"莱卡……你们如果有空的话，能不能去找找他们？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x260DB9C947817000","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1028402009:1":{"text":"採集部隊のみんなが心配だし、僕の新しい家のことも気になるけど……僕は外の獣たちが本当に怖いんだ。","source_cn":"我担心采集队的人，又惦记我那新房子……可我实在是害怕外...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBB0E0E2801CB66D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1028402010:1":{"text":"最近のバドーゾはまったく平和じゃないよ……","source_cn":"最近的瓦度索，实在是不太平呐……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39E317CE5093D8BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1028402011:1":{"text":"エルローランおじさま、安心してください。私たちが状況を見てきますから。","source_cn":"放心吧，埃罗兰叔叔，我们这就去看看情况。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x67C40C2BE1A12F79","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1028402012:1":{"text":"採集部隊はどこに向かったのですか？","source_cn":"采集队去了什么地方？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x11B9BCC490894222","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1028402013:1":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">村の北部にある森林地帯だ</style>。道沿いに北へ向かえば、すぐに見つかるはずだよ。","source_cn":"<style=highlight>村子北边的林场</s...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x893EDEA463CD8942","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:莱卡":{"text":"ライカ","source":"莱卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:发愁的埃罗兰":{"text":"不安げなエルローラン","source":"发愁的埃罗兰","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"ロンロン","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":14,"localized_text_count":13,"speaker_count":3}}